		(property "Notes" "Made in house from 1/8\" x 3/4\" C110 copper flat bar (ASTM B187): cut to 176.05 mm, drill 2 × Ø6.5 at 157 mm, deburr; fitted by hand on the REDCUBE spigots at assembly (not in position files). Pin 1 = the -x terminal, pin 2 = the +x terminal; the footprint's B.Cu net-tie pads sit in each 74660016R's pad 1 ring, 5.7 mm +x of its spigot, so the terminals must be placed with their pad anchors toward +x. The 3D model's bottom face is at z = 0: a board whose spigots stand proud (Node60, 2.0 mm board: 0.6 mm) raises the placed model by that much."
